The Studio dictionary was prepared from publicly available HyperFrames
source code, including Studio and core audio UI definitions. The desktop
dictionary was prepared by static inspection of visible UI strings in the
locally installed official desktop application. The desktop application
code itself is not included or re-licensed by this project. The audited public source version was 0.8.149; the installed
desktop version was 0.1.0 with Electron 44.2.0.

Modifications made for this project include Simplified Chinese translations,
dictionary selection and merging, limited dynamic translation templates,
and the independent macOS launcher and runtime UI translation mechanism.

This source package and launcher do not bundle the original HyperFrames
application source code or executable. HyperFrames must be obtained and
installed separately from its upstream distributor.

